{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108305","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108305","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710830501:1":{"text":"분대장님, 오셨군요! 여기 물입니다.","source_cn":"队长！您回来了！快，这边有水。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4450DF1A27C2372D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710830502:1":{"text":"너무 무리하셨습니다. 조금이라도 쉬셔야 합니다!","source_cn":"您已经连续战斗太久了，必须马上休息一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52F3D54B2F4CB618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710830503:1":{"text":"맞습니다, 분대장님. 뒤는 저희에게 맡기시고...","source_cn":"是啊，队长。剩下的交给属下吧，您——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85889866E658D0A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710830504:1":{"text":"귀네스 분대장님! 지원하러 왔습니다.","source_cn":"格温妮丝队长！那个……我们来支援了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B5DBC9B35F267E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710830505:1":{"text":"저 기억하시나요? 궁정 마법사 달리라고 합니다.","source_cn":"您还记得我吗？我是宫廷法师达利。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75BF5D0B781CB578","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710830506:1":{"text":"물론이죠. 당신의 단서가 큰 도움이 되었는걸요.","source_cn":"当然，您提供的线索帮助了我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF15CAB133210720A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710830507:1":{"text":"하하, 다행이네요. 아, 이쪽은 제 파트너 디츠입니다.","source_cn":"嘿嘿，那就好。哦，对，这位是我的搭档迪兹","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E678951D9BEB95B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710830508:1":{"text":"안녕하십니까, 귀네스 분대장님.","source_cn":"向您致敬，格温妮丝队长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D23E15EDB290CAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710830509:1":{"text":"안녕하세요, 디츠 마법사님.","source_cn":"日安，魔法师迪兹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BF215FD09653889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710830510:1":{"text":"한 가지 제안을 드리고 싶습니다. 지금 상황에서는 물리적인 방어선만으로는 모든 백성들을 지키기가 어렵습니다.","source_cn":"您好，我有一个提议——依照目前的局势，仅靠物理防线很难...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB01683AD892056A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710830511:1":{"text":"극장에 강력한 보호용 마법 장벽을 펼쳐도 될까요?","source_cn":"不知能否在剧场区域张开保护性极强的魔导屏障？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B76E3ED24594987","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710830512:1":{"text":"맞아요! 그 안이면 안전할 거예요. 마물도 쉽게 넘지 못할 겁니다!","source_cn":"对对对！那里面绝对安全！魔物很难越过去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4A6CB4EB1A5FDFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710830513:1":{"text":"정말 천군만마를 얻은 것 같네요!","source_cn":"那真是帮大忙了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05C3D9F8FAB5597E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710830514:1":{"text":"마틴, 가레이츠. 지금 당장 백성들을 극장 중앙으로 대피시켜. 그리고 두 분 마법사님을 도와 방어벽을 구축하도록!","source_cn":"马丁，加雷斯，立刻组织民众向剧场中心集合，配合两位魔法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x891173F5636FB1D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:守备军马丁":{"text":"근위대원 마틴","source":"守备军马丁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军加雷斯":{"text":"근위대원 가레이츠","source":"守备军加雷斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:宫廷魔法师达利":{"text":"궁정 마법사 달리","source":"宫廷魔法师达利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:宫廷魔法师迪兹":{"text":"궁정 마법사 디츠","source":"宫廷魔法师迪兹","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":5}}